OL,3,ADriver who hit Australian MP reversed
OL,4,Ato 'do it a second time', minister says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAustralian MP Helen Haines remains in a
OL,7,Fcritical condition after being hit by a
OL,8,Fcar in what Prime Minister Anthony
OL,9,FAlbanese calls "a deliberate act"
OL,11,FThe suspect allegedly did a U-turn in
OL,12,Forder to strike the MP and then
OL,13,Freversed to ram her a second time, Home
OL,14,FAffairs Minister Tony Burke says
OL,16,FA 43-year-old man, from nearby
OL,17,FTarrawingee, was detained at the scene
OL,18,Fby a passer-by before being taken into
OL,19,Fcustody
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
